        {
            "key": "dc.description.abstract",
            "value": "Items and Tests from the International Cognitive Ability Resource (ICAR). Core team (in alphabetical order): F. Chan, D. Condon, P. Doebler, D. Gühne,  H. Holling, B. Loe, E. Masoudi, J. Rust, W. Revelle, D. Stillwell & L. Sun. Please see readme.txt for funding notes and further ICAR contributors.",
